{"ref":"BDB, חֲנָנִי","hw":"חֲנָנִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֲנָנִי</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>perhaps abbrev. from foll.<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  father of the prophet Jehu <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:1\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.1\">1 K 16:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.7\">7</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 16:7\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.16.7\">2 Ch 16:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 19:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.19.2\">19:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:34\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.34\">20:34</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  brother of Nehemiah <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 1:2\" href=\"/Nehemiah.1.2\">Ne 1:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:2\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.2\">7:2</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  a chief musician of David <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 25:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.25.4\">1 Ch 25:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 25:25\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.25.25\">25</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  a chief musician in time of Nehemiah <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:36\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.36\">Ne 12:36</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  a priest of Ezra’s time <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:20\" href=\"/Ezra.10.20\">Ezr 10:20</a>.","next":"BDB, חֲנַנְיָ֫הוּ","prev":"BDB, חֵנָדָד"}